    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Residential are delighted to introduce 14 The Walk, Coach Yard Meadows - a fine semi detached residence built by Westin Homes in 2024. This well presented home is offered in excellent condition throughout and boasts an A2 energy rating. The rooms are deceptively spacious and the two main bedrooms come with double fitted wardrobes. The elegant kitchen enjoys a range of integrated appliances.\r\n\r\nCoach Yard Meadows is convenient to all amenities with shops, schools, pubs, restaurants, gyms, parks and playgrounds close by. The main street of Clane Village is only a short stroll away. The N7 and M4 road networks are easily accessible and provide a direct route to the M50. The Arrow train service is available from Sallins.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to 118 square meters and comprises entrance hallway, lounge, kitchen/dining room, utility room, three bedrooms (main en-suite), bathroom and guest wc. Viewing is highly recommended and by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\n1.09m x 2.24m (3' 7\" x 7' 4\")\r\n1.30m x 4.69m (4' 3\" x 15' 5\")\r\nUnderstairs storage.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\n1.45m x 1.52m (4' 9\" x 5' 0\")\r\nWhite wc and wash hand basin with tiled splashback. Shaver light. Porcelain tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\n4.89m x 3.56m (16' 1\" x 11' 8\")\r\nFeature bay window.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\n4.85m x 6.00m (15' 11\" x 19' 8\")\r\nHigh specification wall and base fitted units. Large area of worktop space. Siemens electric hob with chrome splashback and extractor hood. Integrated Bosch microwave oven, double oven and fridge freezer. Centre island with stainless steel sink unit, extra storage and integrated Bosch dishwasher. Tv point. French doors to garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n1.46m x 1.55m (4' 9\" x 5' 1\")\r\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer. Area of worktop space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nHotpress.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.78m x 3.60m (12' 5\" x 11' 10\")\r\nTo rear. Double fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n1.09m x 2.48m (3' 7\" x 8' 2\")\r\nWhite wc and wash hand basin with tiled splashback and shaver light. Tiled pumped shower. Heated towel rack. Porcelain tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.76m x 4.17m (9' 1\" x 13' 8\")\r\nDouble fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.12m x 3.81m (6' 11\" x 12' 6\")\r\nTo front.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.48m x 2.62m (4' 10\" x 8' 7\")\r\nWhite wc, wash hand basin and bath. Shaver light. Generous wall tiles. Heated towel rack. Porcelain tiled floor.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront: Cobblelock driveway with space for two cars. Outside light. Well stocked flowerbed. Side access to rear.\r\n\r\nRear: Well maintained lawn. Patio area. Outside tap. Outside light. Garden is approximately 11.30 meters in length."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "BER A2\r\nSmoke, heat and CO2 detectors\r\nCAT 6 cable wiring\r\nElegant high quality kitchen with integrated appliances\r\nHigh levels of insulation in floors, walls and roofs\r\nAir to water heat pump with radiators\r\nDemand control ventilation system\r\nSuper warm construction\r\nQualifies for Homebond Guarantee Scheme\r\nOutside light\r\nOutside tap\r\nCobblelock driveway"
      },
